OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'force of nature'
OL,4,Akilled in taxi crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman killed when she
OL,7,Fwas thrown through the window of a taxi
OL,8,Fduring a crash have paid tribute to a
OL,9,F"force of nature" whose death had "left
OL,10,Fan enormous void".
OL,12,FDonna Brighton, from Leicester, had
OL,13,Fbeen out with her friends celebrating
OL,14,Fher 60th birthday on 16 September 2023
OL,15,Fand was making her way home from the
OL,16,Frailway station.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
